            <tr><td>Chemical processes in the environment and their impacts</td><td><b>Environmental chemistry</b></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Legislation, rules and moral dilemmas of environmental protection</td><td><b>Environmental policy and management</b></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Meeting current demands without endangering future generations</td><td><b>Sustainable development</b></td></tr>
